%%{init: {'theme': 'base'}}%%
flowchart TD
  Reg[POST webhook register] --> V1{Validate URL: HTTPS, no private IP, no metadata}
  V1 -->|reject| R1[400]
  V1 --> Store[Store endpoint + secret]
  Event[rule_set.changed] --> Load[Load endpoint]
  Load --> V2{Re-validate URL immediately before fetch}
  V2 -->|DNS changed to private| R2[Mark delivery failed]
  V2 --> Fetch[fetch: redirect follow = never]
  Fetch -->|3xx| R3[Fail. Body not read into log]
  Fetch -->|2xx| Ok[Record success status only]
  Fetch -->|timeout or 5xx| Retry[Backoff retry]
